Create styles using `StyleSheet.create`:

```jsx
import { StyleSheet } from 'react-native';

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  container: {
    backgroundColor: '#fff',
    padding: 20,
  },
  text: {
    fontSize: 16,
    color: 'black',
  },
});

<View style={styles.container}><Text style={styles.text}>Hello</Text></View>
```

You can compose multiple styles using arrays:

```jsx
<Text style={[styles.baseText, styles.boldText]}>Combined Style</Text>

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  baseText: {
    fontSize: 16,
    color: 'black',
  },
  boldText: {
    fontWeight: 'bold',
  },
});
```

```jsx
import { Platform } from 'react-native';

const styles = StyleSheet.create({
  button: {
    padding: Platform.OS === 'ios' ? 10 : 15,
  },
});
```
